  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant is for institutional support to the Inter Regional Meeting of Bishops of Southern Africa (IMBISA). It will be applied towards the following activities:

Outcome
Increased institutional capacity of IMBISA

Activities:
1. On going financial accompaniment support from KFM
3. Institutional support to IMBISA

Indicators
1. Institutional capacity assessment conducted
2. Financial capacity strengthened and technical support provided
3. IMBISA&apos;s institutional capacity strenghtened</narrative>
  </description>
